<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Good For You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Isabel LaRosa</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Raven</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0isd3qAsRc0f4sOlsNn4cB</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.598" end="00:05.232">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:05.232" end="00:09.225" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.225" end="00:11.522">Boy, I hope you know you're trouble</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.522" end="00:14.527">I can see the devil in your eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.527" end="00:16.630">You never show me how you struggle</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.630" end="00:19.350">But we both know that you're terrified</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.350" end="00:21.826">Yeah, I think I'm seeing double</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.826" end="00:25.345">I'm all yours, you know, boy, I can't lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.345" end="00:27.792">Can't lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.792" end="00:29.292" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.196" end="00:30.725">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.725" end="00:33.142">Break the rules I shouldn't for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.142" end="00:38.179">Kiss you like there's nothin' to lose (Nothin' to lose, nothin' to lose)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.179" end="00:40.836">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.836" end="00:43.815">Your God won't like what I do for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.815" end="00:48.764">Darlin', I don't care what you put me through (What you put me through, what you put me through)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.764" end="00:50.264" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.709" end="00:52.484">Boy, you know you talk so nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.484" end="00:55.605">Empty promises just ain't enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.605" end="00:57.914">Baby, just let go of your pride</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.914" end="01:00.622">And I'll forgive you for the way it was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.622" end="01:03.191">Yeah, you're pretty when you lie</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.191" end="01:07.366">But I forget that, darlin', when we touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.366" end="01:09.183">We touch</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.183" end="01:10.683" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.432" end="01:12.053">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.053" end="01:14.271">Break the rules I shouldn't for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.271" end="01:19.400">Kiss you like there's nothin' to lose (Nothin' to lose, nothin' to lose)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.400" end="01:21.957">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.957" end="01:24.625">Your God won't like what I do for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.625" end="01:29.727">Darlin', I don't care what you put me through (What you put me through, what you put me through)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.727" end="01:32.071" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.071" end="01:34.459">Good for you, good for you, good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.459" end="01:37.225">Good for you, good for you, good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.225" end="01:42.507">Good for you, good for you, good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.507" end="01:44.918">Good for you, good for you, good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.918" end="01:47.561">Good for you, good for you, good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.561" end="01:51.539">Good for you, good for you, good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.539" end="01:59.539" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.348" end="02:05.905">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.905" end="02:08.535">Break the rules I shouldn't for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.535" end="02:13.478">Kiss you like there's nothin' to lose (Nothin' to lose, nothin' to lose)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.478" end="02:16.291">Baby, I just wanna look good for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.291" end="02:18.674">Your God won't like what I do for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.674" end="02:22.674">Darlin', I don't care what you put me through (What you put me through, what you put me through)</p></div></body></tt>